    hollow outline instead of solid ink. Where the artwork's strokes are thinner than
    the band they close into solid ink, exactly as an outlined letter does at this
    size. One path, even-odd fill: the counters stay real holes. The system tints
    status-bar icons itself, so only the alpha shape matters here.
